            <ArticleTitle>Gold open access: the best of both worlds.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s12471-017-1064-2</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Gold open access provides free distribution of trustworthy scientific knowledge for everyone. As publication modus, it has to withstand the bad reputation of predatory journals and overcome the preconceptions of those who believe that open access is synonymous with poor quality articles and high costs. Gold open access has a bright future and will serve the scientific community, clinicians without academic affiliations and the general public.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
